        "body": "The Department of Defense is the primary buyer, obligating $397M. The Department of the Interior obligated $3M and the National Aeronautics and Space Administration obligated $2.4M. The Department of Agriculture obligated $31.4K, and several agencies show zero or negative obligations, including the Department of the Treasury at $0."
      },
      {
        "heading": "What markets and work areas dominate Pennsylvania State University's federal business?",
        "body": "Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) is the dominant market, with $399M. Related R&D and academic markets include Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences at $2.4M and Colleges, Universities, and Professional Schools at $70.8K. Several other NAICS categories show minimal or zero obligations, and two categories show negative adjustments."
      }
